Risk Maps

Installation:
- Link risk.apache2-conf to /etc/apache2/sites-enabled, be sure to set correct paths in this file

Notes:
- /database dir must belong to www-data group and have read/write permissions, ensure the db file contained inside also hase the same permissions
- /storage must have read/write permissions for thumbnails and maps to be stored by django
- /static/admin must point to your django install static admin files, something like: /usr/local/lib/python2.6/dist-packages/Django-1.2.5-py2.6.egg/django/contrib/admin/media
- See pip-requirements.txt for list of package dependencies

To Import Maps:
> python manage.py shell
(Now in Python Shell)
> import MapImport
> MapImport.run()

